cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use or build on this dataset, please cite it using these
  metadata, together with the corpus it reads and the INSP situation
  reports behind that.
title: >-
  bvd-capacity: Ebola treatment and isolation facilities in the 2026
  DRC Bundibugyo virus outbreak
abstract: >-
  When each Ebola treatment, transit and isolation facility appeared,
  opened and came under strain during the 2026 Bundibugyo virus
  disease outbreak in the Democratic Republic of the Congo, read from
  the INSP situation reports. Every row carries the French sentence it
  came from, and that sentence is checked character for character
  against the report before the row is kept. Opening dates are given
  as intervals, because the reports state an opening date for no
  facility.
authors:
  - family-names: Sherratt
    given-names: Katharine
repository-code: "https://github.com/kathsherratt/bvd-capacity"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - Ebola
  - Bundibugyo virus
  - Democratic Republic of the Congo
  - health system capacity
  - Ebola treatment centre
  - outbreak response
references:
  - type: software
    title: >-
      bvd-sitreps: a machine-readable corpus of the INSP situation
      reports for the 2026 DRC Bundibugyo virus outbreak
    authors:
      - family-names: Sherratt
        given-names: Katharine
    year: 2026
    url: "https://github.com/epiforecasts/bvd-sitreps"
    notes: >-
      The corpus this repository reads. It never opens a PDF.
  - type: report
    title: "Situation reports on the 17th Ebola virus disease epidemic"
    authors:
      - name: >-
          Institut National de Sante Publique, Democratic Republic
          of the Congo
    year: 2026
    url: "https://insp.cd/ebola-17eme-epidemie/"
    notes: >-
      The source of every quote in this dataset.
  - type: database
    title: "GRID3 COD Health Facilities, version 8.0"
    authors:
      - name: >-
          Center for International Earth Science Information Network
          (CIESIN), Columbia University
      - name: >-
          Ministere de la Sante Publique, Hygiene et Prevention,
          Democratic Republic of the Congo
      - name: GRID3
    year: 2025
    doi: 10.7916/f1ft-y872
    notes: >-
      The canonical place and facility vocabulary in
      data/reference/grid3_places.csv. CC BY 4.0.
